<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Value Health raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Value Health raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Value Health Inc to long-term buy from accumulate and maintained its near-term neutral rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Value Health ended at 18-1/4 on Monday.</p>
</text>
